## Slide 3: What are Agentic AI Tools?

* Tools = What AI uses to do work

👉 Simple line:
**“Tools are the hands of the AI”**

👉 Image: Robot with multiple arms/tools

---

## Slide 4: Types of Tools (Simple)

* APIs → talk to systems
* Databases → get/save data
* Messaging → send alerts (Teams/Slack)
* Files → read/write data

👉 Image: Toolbox with labels

---

## Slide 5: Example (Simple Flow)

“Check system health”

* AI reads logs
* Calls API
* Sends alert

👉 Say: “AI is not magic—it just uses tools smartly.”

